  "content_id": "16136232",
  "title": "XRP (Ripple) Network Fees",
  "description": "XRP (Ripple) Network – Fast and Predictable\nXRP is known for its speed and incredibly low fees, designed specifically for payments and fin...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8WDVWZW632MQJB1YWA\">XRP (Ripple) Network – Fast and Predictable</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">XRP is known for its speed and incredibly low fees, designed specifically for payments and financial institutions.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8WJK79XQN6CCBTH4GS\">How XRP Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Minimal and fixed</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Based on a dynamic base fee</b> adjusted by the network<br>Paid in <b>XRP</b>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge automatically handles the tiny fee calculation for you.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8WQF7343Q5B19F99D4\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>One setting</b> – XRP transactions are fast and cheap by design.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8W4PKEV33EH3VQ5AP4\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Usually <b>$0.0001 to $0.001 USD</b>—even large payments cost almost nothing.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ2QV8W32Y85Z4HYYED3Z0Y\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">XRP’s fast and cheap transactions make it ideal for quick money movement. Edge Wallet makes XRP transfers seamless without any fee guesswork.</p>",
